# Merge-review conflict Decide probe — manual deeper inhabit (temp fixture or live MERGE_HEAD)
# Prefer: cargo xtask dogfood merge-review --with-conflict (tempfile hard spine).
# This queue is for a workspace that already has MERGE_HEAD / conflict chrome.
#
# Synthetic vs live Decide (runner contract — see zed-dogfood skill):
#   Default hard spine (no Grok): Start → Review Diff → Summarizing →
#     InjectMergeReviewDogfoodSummary → L2 hard on capture log only (rail alone ≠ green) →
#     Use Both / resolve-ours / Record soft L3 (product evidence; soft-skip if unavailable).
#   Optional --decide-live-agent: soft-poll (capture_log | discuss_rail); soft-skip → synthetic.
#   Inject needs prior StartMergeReview + Review Diff pending (Summarizing / capture target).
# Gate style: expect: is AND hard; hit: is diagnostic OR only.
open
wait:4000
look:room
lines:15
action:surmount::StartMergeReview
wait:10000
look:room
expect:Merge review
# Decision chrome (conflict-specific; Review Diff alone is not enough):
hit:Use Both|Resolve with Agent|Summarize this conflict|Discuss conflict|Review Diff
lines:40
# Review Diff path (soft in runner; here hard-expect button only when chrome painted)
action:git::ReviewDiff
wait:5000
look:room
hit:Summarizing|Discuss conflict|Record decision|Use Both|Review Diff
lines:40
# Hard L2 synthetic capture (same production path as runner; needs Start + Review Diff first):
action:surmount::InjectMergeReviewDogfoodSummary
wait:2000
look:room
# L2: capture ok path=… on stderr; Discuss/Record rail when painted
hit:Discuss conflict|Record decision|Use Both|Keep fork|Take upstream
lines:40
# Soft L3 network-free decide proof when button present (soft-click may fail if node stale — re-look first)
look:room
hit:Use Both|Keep fork|Take upstream|Discuss conflict|Record decision
lines:30
inventory
stderr:merge
